# Image generation goes through Replicate or straight through the OpenAI API.
# Set one key (or both). With both set, Replicate is used unless you pick:
# FLIPBOOK_PROVIDER=openai

# Replicate — https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens
REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_...

# OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional: override the image model (see src/server/models.ts for aliases).
# Replicate serves all of them; OpenAI serves its own (sunburst, flare, gpt-image-2).
# FLIPBOOK_MODEL=sunburst
